{"organizations": [], "uuid": "7099a071e318e5adc442b87f446cd940e540caf7", "thread": {"social": {"gplus": {"shares": 0}, "pinterest": {"shares": 0}, "vk": {"shares": 0}, "linkedin": {"shares": 0}, "facebook": {"likes": 0, "shares": 0, "comments": 0}, "stumbledupon": {"shares": 0}}, "site_full": "www.edigest.hk", "main_image": "https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/3-_10058582915c09d4a4053bf.png", "site_section": "http://www.edigest.hk/feed", "section_title": "經濟一週", "url": "https://www.edigest.hk/79572/investment/23%e6%ad%b2-%e6%8a%95%e8%b3%87-%e5%a4%a7%e5%ad%b8-%e7%95%a2%e6%a5%ad%e5%ad%a3-%e6%9c%ac%e9%87%91-%e6%87%89%e6%80%a5%e5%9f%ba%e9%87%91-%e9%a2%a8%e9%9a%aa/", "country": "HK", "title": "23歲畢業生初學投資 理財3部曲 先建立應急基金", "performance_score": 0, "site": "edigest.hk", "participants_count": 1, "title_full": "", "spam_score": 0.0, "site_type": "news", "published": "2018-12-09T05:00:00.000+02:00", "replies_count": 0, "uuid": "7099a071e318e5adc442b87f446cd940e540caf7"}, "author": "投資", "url": "https://www.edigest.hk/79572/investment/23%e6%ad%b2-%e6%8a%95%e8%b3%87-%e5%a4%a7%e5%ad%b8-%e7%95%a2%e6%a5%ad%e5%ad%a3-%e6%9c%ac%e9%87%91-%e6%87%89%e6%80%a5%e5%9f%ba%e9%87%91-%e9%a2%a8%e9%9a%aa/", "ord_in_thread": 0, "title": "23歲畢業生初學投資 理財3部曲 先建立應急基金", "locations": [], "entities": {"persons": [], "locations": [], "organizations": []}, "highlightText": "", "language": "chineset", "persons": [], "text": "on December 9, 2018 at 11:00 am 正正是大學畢業季，一眾云云學子在學校走到了社會，除了煩惱找工作外，還要開始學懂 投資 。但才剛剛走出社會，本金不多，該如何投資？ 如何建立投資組合？那種投資才適合我？ 400;\">交易應用程序使在沒有大量資金的情況下，都比以往都更容易開始投資。</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">超過200萬人使用Robinhood購買像Apple （AAPL）這樣的個股，而且無需支付交易費。</span></p> <figure style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/iphone_18602024885bf37980cdd5d.png\" alt=\"23歲 投資 大學 畢業季 本金 長期目標 風險 應急基金\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" /><figcaption 400;\">但是如果你想要聰明地投資你的金錢，那麼幾乎所有的註冊財務規劃師都會告訴你避免購買個股。</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">不要勉強自己，大多數20多歲的年輕人都沒有額外的現金來投資，在投資股票市場之前，應該先弄清楚投資的風險。</span></p> <figure id=\"attachment_79585\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-79585 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/young_3611502585c09d67b89bd1.png\" alt=\"23歲 投資 大學 畢業季 本金 長期目標 風險 應急基金\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/young_3611502585c09d67b89bd1.png 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/young_3611502585c09d67b89bd1-800x480.png 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/young_3611502585c09d67b89bd1-768x461.png 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/young_3611502585c09d67b89bd1-165x99.png 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/young_3611502585c09d67b89bd1-392x235.png 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/young_3611502585c09d67b89bd1-360x215.png 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：unsplash</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_4 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <h2><strong>【投資】首先，建立一個可以支付三至六個月費用的應急基金</strong></h2> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">如果你失去了工作，或者突然需要一筆應急的醫療費用，都毋需要擔心。</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">您需要的是可以隨時拿出一筆現金出來，而不需要擔心在股市下跌時的損失。</span></p> <figure id=\"attachment_78337\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-78337 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80.jpg\" alt=\"23歲 投資 大學 畢業季 本金 長期目標 風險 應急基金\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80- <h2><strong>其次，了解你的每月開支</strong></h2> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">包括任何學生貸款賬單、卡數、交通費用等。</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">並且在考慮投資之前，儘量償還信用卡的債務。</span></p> <h2><strong>第三，決定你的目標</strong></h2> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">問一問自己：「你為了什麼而儲蓄？」這將幫助你確定是否應該去投資、該投資多少以及投資的內容。</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">也許你正在為婚禮、上車、創業等而儲錢。如果這些短期目標將在未來四年內出現，就不要將這筆錢投放在股市中，反而應該將其保存在儲蓄戶口中。</span></p> <figure id=\"attachment_79036\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-79036 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/target_10757118275c06203465566.png\" alt=\"23歲 投資 大學 畢業季 本金 長期目標 風險 應急基金\" <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">投資是為了長期的目標，例如是退休或財務獨立等，讓你可以在60歲之前就不用再工作，提早退休。</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">不要害怕在20多歲時創造一個積極的投資組合。例如是一個目標日期基金，該基金會根據你的年齡自動設置你的投資並可隨時間更改。</span></p> <figure id=\"attachment_78866\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-78866 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/20181203h005_19855645045c04dcdd9417f.jpg\" alt=\"23歲 投資 大學 畢業季 本金 長期目標 風險 應急基金\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/20181203h005_19855645045c04dcdd9417f.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/20181203h005_19855645045c04dcdd9417f-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/20181203h005_19855645045c04dcdd9417f-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/20181203h005_19855645045c04dcdd9417f-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/20181203h005_19855645045c04dcdd9417f-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/20181203h005_19855645045c04dcdd9417f-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：photoAC</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_7 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">如果你認為現在是開設經紀賬戶的最佳時機，專家都會建議你不要單打獨鬥，你或沒有足夠的資金與一些理財規劃師合作。</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">但你可以選擇機器人顧問，它會幫助你以少量費用創建投資組合。</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">你只要填寫一份關於年齡和收入的簡短問卷，它就會提供適當的投資組合。</span></p> <figure id=\"attachment_79583\" style=\"width: 1000px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-79583 size-full\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/com_7985290085c09d58812b15.png\" alt=\"23歲 投資 大學 畢業季 本金 長期目標 風險 應急基金\" width=\"1000\" height=\"600\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/com_7985290085c09d58812b15.png 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/com_7985290085c09d58812b15-800x480.png 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/com_7985290085c09d58812b15-768x461.png 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/com_7985290085c09d58812b15-165x99.png 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/com_7985290085c09d58812b15-392x235.png 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/com_7985290085c09d58812b15- <h2> 延伸閱讀：</h2> <h2 class=\"article__title article__title--single\">集中注碼加大回報 滾大資產最重要的心法</h2> <p>【滾大資產最重要的心法】「假設一位25歲年輕人，以50萬元創業，公司連續25年以年均30%增長，他的身家足夠在主板上市嗎?」答案是勉強可以。這位年輕人於50歲時，身家大約3.5億元。</p> <p>撰文：周梓霖<span class=\"s1\">｜ 圖片：新傳媒資料室、<a href=\"https://unsplash.com/\">unsplash</a></span></p> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_9 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p>事實上，筆者很佩服白手興家，並能把公司上市的企業家，要在年輕時以極高增速滾大資本，而且要捱得過大大小小的低潮，在市場生存下來，絕對是高手。</p> <p>不要輕看連續25年的30%年均回報率，這個成績放在投資界絕對是「股神」級數，拿此佳績出來集資相信瞬間超額認購。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78810\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-78810 size-medium\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/hkd_7771252915c04b7249ffb3-800x480.png\" alt=\"滾大資產, 滾雪球, 投資, 心法, 回報, 上市\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/hkd_7771252915c04b7249ffb3-800x480.png 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/hkd_7771252915c04b7249ffb3-768x461.png 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/hkd_7771252915c04b7249ffb3.png 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/hkd_7771252915c04b7249ffb3-165x99.png 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/hkd_7771252915c04b7249ffb3-392x235.png 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/hkd_7771252915c04b7249ffb3-360x215.png 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：新傳媒資料室</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_10 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p>但原來以這個「股神」級投資回報，只是勉強能夠上市，那麼要做上市公司大股東豈不是高手中的高手?</p> <p>正確，白手興家的上市公司老闆必定是以極度激進手法滾大資產。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78773\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-78773 size-medium\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/aa_17033784535c049a9e848aa-800x480.jpg\" alt=\"滾大資產, 滾雪球, 投資, 心法, 回報, 上市\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/aa_17033784535c049a9e848aa-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/aa_17033784535c049a9e848aa-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/aa_17033784535c049a9e848aa.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/aa_17033784535c049a9e848aa-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/aa_17033784535c049a9e848aa-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/12/aa_17033784535c049a9e848aa-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：unsplash</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_11 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <h2>集中注碼可加大回報</h2> <p>筆者並不是叫大家將資產滾大到上市，才算是成功投資者，但這批老闆的做法及心法是很值得參考。</p> <p>筆者曾再三強調「集中注碼可以大幅提高回報率」，這句話價值千金，但要實踐絕對不容易。</p> <p>沒有家庭負擔、家庭有強大支持或人脈關係的年輕人，用集中注碼方式博高回報率，是資產倍增的好方法。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78585\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-78585 size-medium\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_10716901555bdfae57d6f49_18469657765c00e54d4501b-800x480.jpg\" alt=\"滾大資產, 滾雪球, 投資, 心法, 回報, 上市\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_10716901555bdfae57d6f49_18469657765c00e54d4501b-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_10716901555bdfae57d6f49_18469657765c00e54d4501b-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_10716901555bdfae57d6f49_18469657765c00e54d4501b.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_10716901555bdfae57d6f49_18469657765c00e54d4501b-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_10716901555bdfae57d6f49_18469657765c00e54d4501b-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_10716901555bdfae57d6f49_18469657765c00e54d4501b-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：unsplash</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_12 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p>當然要採用進取手法爭取回報必須有前提，就是大家自身的實力必須要達到一定水平。</p> <p>投資世界非常殘酷，沒有實力的人絕對難以發大達。</p> <p>道理很簡單，如果投資本身都不賺錢，那激進與否都不會賺大錢。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78583\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-78583 size-medium\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/20181105n04_12390961635bdffbfd7a660_20277436915c00e546415c5-800x480.jpg\" alt=\"滾大資產, 滾雪球, 投資, 心法, 回報, 上市\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/20181105n04_12390961635bdffbfd7a660_20277436915c00e546415c5-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/20181105n04_12390961635bdffbfd7a660_20277436915c00e546415c5-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/20181105n04_12390961635bdffbfd7a660_20277436915c00e546415c5.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/20181105n04_12390961635bdffbfd7a660_20277436915c00e546415c5-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/20181105n04_12390961635bdffbfd7a660_20277436915c00e546415c5-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/20181105n04_12390961635bdffbfd7a660_20277436915c00e546415c5-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：unsplash</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_13 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <h2>心態上要接受運氣低落</h2> <p>第二點是滾雪球重中之重，就是心態上要接受運氣低落的可能性。</p> <p>單獨幾年獲得高回報率不難，但最難處理的反而是不能掌握的因素。</p> <p>誇張地講，就算能力比「股神」畢菲特更強，但博殺的過程中，難保不會因為意料之外的因素而沒頂。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78581\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-78581 size-medium\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1931awin01_14596286205bdc343b68e00_10466777395c00e54309cf5-800x480.jpg\" alt=\"滾大資產, 滾雪球, 投資, 心法, 回報, 上市\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1931awin01_14596286205bdc343b68e00_10466777395c00e54309cf5-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1931awin01_14596286205bdc343b68e00_10466777395c00e54309cf5-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1931awin01_14596286205bdc343b68e00_10466777395c00e54309cf5.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1931awin01_14596286205bdc343b68e00_10466777395c00e54309cf5-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1931awin01_14596286205bdc343b68e00_10466777395c00e54309cf5-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1931awin01_14596286205bdc343b68e00_10466777395c00e54309cf5-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：iStock</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_14 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <h2>持續大贏的心法</h2> <p>跟打撲克牌一樣，只要新手擁有靚絕無比的手牌，世界高手都會輸給新手。</p> <p>其實每個投資者都希望自己能夠持續大贏，但事實上意料以外的事總會發生，最重要是有接受現實的心態，以及客觀地分析情況，以判斷如何部署倉位。</p> <p>換言之，滾雪球最重要的心法是要做到「手中無劍、心中有劍」，抱著一個自己或會失利的心態去達到更高層次。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78582\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-78582 size-medium\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934avba01_10096470865bf797a2dc305_4673244045c00e5449c2e9-800x480.jpg\" alt=\"滾大資產, 滾雪球, 投資, 心法, 回報, 上市\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934avba01_10096470865bf797a2dc305_4673244045c00e5449c2e9-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934avba01_10096470865bf797a2dc305_4673244045c00e5449c2e9-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934avba01_10096470865bf797a2dc305_4673244045c00e5449c2e9.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934avba01_10096470865bf797a2dc305_4673244045c00e5449c2e9-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934avba01_10096470865bf797a2dc305_4673244045c00e5449c2e9-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/1934avba01_10096470865bf797a2dc305_4673244045c00e5449c2e9-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：iStock</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_15 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p>最後，跟進9月底筆者在本欄談過的春泉產業信託（01426），這次要約真是可以寫入港股史上高價收購反敗的經典案例。</p> <p>當時筆者說，即使太盟出高溢價收購市場股份，要約成功亦有一定難度，沒有建議買入，博要約通過。</p> <p>事實上太盟出價相當有誠意，由原先每股4.85元提價至5.3元，作價貼近亞洲估值最貴的房地產信託基金（REIT）領展房產基金（00823）估值，而且溢價高達八年股息，以投資角度看幾乎沒有可能否決接受要約。</p> <figure id=\"attachment_78405\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"wp-image-78405 size-medium\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/us-dlooar_15887310315c00aa470897f-800x480.png\" alt=\"滾大資產, 滾雪球, 投資, 心法, 回報, 上市\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/us-dlooar_15887310315c00aa470897f-800x480.png 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/us-dlooar_15887310315c00aa470897f-768x461.png 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/us-dlooar_15887310315c00aa470897f.png 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/us-dlooar_15887310315c00aa470897f-165x99.png 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/us-dlooar_15887310315c00aa470897f-392x235.png 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/us-dlooar_15887310315c00aa470897f-360x215.png 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-caption-text\">圖片：unsplash</figcaption></figure> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_16 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p>不過，要約並不能單從投資回報率角度出發，亦要從商業角度考慮。</p> <p>日本營商文化向來極重視商業夥伴的長期合作關係，故此日籍大股東可能有不少商業夥伴支持。</p> <p>這個案例相當有參考性，以後參與要約須將商業關係一併納入考慮。</p> <p><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-78337 size-medium\" src=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-800x480.jpg\" alt=\"滾大資產, 滾雪球, 投資, 心法, 回報, 上市\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-800x480.jpg 800w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-768x461.jpg 768w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80.jpg 1000w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-165x99.jpg 165w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-392x235.jpg 392w, https://images.edigest.hk/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/aa_2880451755bffc00351d80-360x215.jpg 360w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></p> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_17 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">免責聲明：本專頁刊載的所有投資分析技巧，只可作參考用途。市場瞬息萬變，讀者在作出投資決定前理應審慎，並主動掌握市場最新狀況。若不幸招致任何損失，概與本刊及相關作者無關。而本集團旗下網站或社交平台的網誌內容及觀點，僅屬筆者個人意見，與新傳媒立場無關。本集團旗下網站對因上述人士張貼之資訊內容所帶來之損失或損害概不負責。</span></p> </div> <div class=\"_page_ _page_18 \"> <div class='code-block code-block-12' style='text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-top:8px;margin-bottom:8px;'data-type='all'></div> <h2>延伸閱